WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.500
Prithvika, by Soham Khetan. A research campus for reclaimed coal-mining land in Chandrapur. Wetlands, bioswales and planting belts shape the proposal.

00:09.500 --> 00:19.000
Research wings and courtyards bring together geochemistry, revegetation and mineral-processing studies.

00:19.000 --> 00:29.000
Fly-ash brick, stone and timber. Terraces, green roofs and shaded connections support a campus rooted in ecological repair. This is an academic proposal; environmental outcomes are not verified on a built campus.
